	<input id="hdnPageStatus" name="hdnPageStatus" type="hidden" value="Published" />

				<h1 id="versionHeadLine" class="headline">

Important Election Dates and Information		</h1>
	
		<div id="cc5f8c90dc-b4cb-431b-90ee-10648f8df655" data-containerid="5f8c90dc-b4cb-431b-90ee-10648f8df655" class="pageContent cpGrid cpGrid24"  data-contentcontainerbreakpoint="15" data-smoothscrolling="True">
			

		<div class="row outer wide"><!--
--><div class="outer col col24 first last" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="bdf3f875-351e-4b6d-80d0-3395694d8f18">				
	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col24 first last idd0ab6911-dd8b-4cce-9f19-0fe3f15e2ef5" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="d0ab6911-dd8b-4cce-9f19-0fe3f15e2ef5">	
<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor63693a8b-c615-4f6f-b3ab-93e3ed41d487" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <p>See important dates, including when ballots are mailed, registration deadlines, and Election Day details for the current election.&nbsp;<br><br>Looking for upcoming election dates? Visit our <a href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/6795/2026-Elections-Calendar"><strong>2026 Election Dates and Deadlines page</strong></a> to see dates and activity schedules for future elections.</p><hr style="border:1px solid black; margin-bottom: 1.5em;"><h2 style="color:black; font-size: 1.5em;">November 3 General Election</h2><h3 style="background-color:#284860; color:white; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px;margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em;">Important Dates</h3><table style="margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 5px; width: 95%;"><caption style="text-align: left; font-weight: bold; padding: 0.5em 0; color:white;">&nbsp;Election Dates &amp; Deadlines</caption><tbody><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid white;"><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; padding: 10px;" data-cell-padding="10px">September 18</th><td data-cell-padding="12px" style="padding: 10px;">Military and overseas ballots mail</td></tr><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid white;"><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; padding: 10px;" data-cell-padding="10px">October 1</th><td data-cell-padding="12px" style="padding: 10px;">Voters&apos; pamphlet delivery begins</td></tr><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid white;"><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; padding: 10px;" data-cell-padding="10px">October 9</th><td data-cell-padding="12px" style="padding: 10px;"><a href="https://snohomishcountywa.gov/5726/Find-a-Ballot-Drop-Box">Ballot drop boxes</a> open, ballots mail</td></tr><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid white;"><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; padding: 10px;" data-cell-padding="10px">October 26</th><td data-cell-padding="12px" style="padding: 10px;">Last day for voters to <a href="https://voter.votewa.gov/WhereToVote.aspx">register or update voter information</a> online or by mail</td></tr><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid white;"><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; padding: 10px;" data-cell-padding="10px">November 3<br><em>Election Day</em></th><td data-cell-padding="12px" style="padding: 10px;">Last day for voters to&nbsp;<a href="/3972/Voter-Registration">register or update voter information</a> in person<br>Last day for voters to <a href="/231/How-To-Vote">return voted ballot</a></td></tr><tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid white;"><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; padding: 10px;" data-cell-padding="12px">November 24</th><td data-cell-padding="10px" style="padding: 10px;"><a href="/5731">County canvassing board</a> certifies the county election results</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 style="background-color:#284860; color:white; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px;margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em;">Election Information</h3><p>Find additional information related to the current election using the links below.</p><h4 style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;"><a style="color:black;" href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/5722/See-Whats-on-the-Ballot">What&apos;s on the ballot</a></h4><p style="margin-left: 20px;">Your voters&rsquo; guide is the best place to get information on the candidates and measures that appear on your ballot. Visit our <a href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/5722/See-Whats-on-the-Ballot">What&apos;s on the Ballot page</a> to learn more about the Online Voters&apos; Guide (VoteWA), see PDFs of the Local Voters&apos; Pamphlet, a sample ballot containing all races and measures, and more.</p><h4 style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;"><a style="color:black;" href="https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/0a219ac968ee4ddc833491fc7b7a7ca9/"><strong>Find your district and elected officials</strong></a></h4><p style="margin-left: 20px;">Use our <a href="https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/0a219ac968ee4ddc833491fc7b7a7ca9/">interactive map</a> to find your voting district and learn who your local, state, and federal elected officials are.</p><h4 style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;"><a style="color:black;" href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/5723/Track-Your-Ballot">Track your ballot</a></h4><p style="margin-left: 20px;">You can track your ballot online at <a href="//VoteWA.gov">VoteWA.gov</a> or sign up for ballot text alerts so you&apos;ll always know when to expect your ballot and when your vote has been received and processed. Get instructions and find more tools and resources on our <a href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/5723/Track-Your-Ballot">Track Your Ballot</a> page.</p><h4 style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;"><a style="color:black;" href="/5731">Observe elections</a></h4><p style="margin-left: 20px;">All election activities are open for observation. If you would like a guided tour of the Elections Center, you can <a href="https://outlook.office365.com/owa/calendar/SnohomishCountyElectionsDivision@snoco.onmicrosoft.com/bookings/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><strong>sign up using our booking page</strong></a>. Depending on available staff, guided tours may be provided without booking a time. Snohomish County Elections also offers elections observation information sessions to assist observers in getting the most out of their visit. Learn more about <a href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/5731/Observe-the-Elections-Process">election observation opportunities</a>.</p><h4 style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;"><a style="color:black;" href="https://lwvsnoho.org/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=108940&module_id=563630">League of Women Voters Candidate Forums</a></h4><p style="margin-left: 20px;">Need more information to make your voting choice? Checkout the <a href="https://lwvsnoho.org/">Snohomish County League of Women Voters&apos;</a> nonpartisan <a href="https://lwvsnoho.org/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=108940&module_id=563630">online candidate forums</a>. These forums provide an opportunity for you to hear directly from the candidates in contested races as they respond to questions from a moderator. You can tune in for the live streams or watch the recordings.</p><h3 style="background-color:#284860; color:white; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px;margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em;">Election Results and Statistics</h3><h4 style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;"><a style="color:black;" href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/5737/Get-Current-and-Past-Election-Results-an">Ballot Return Statistics Dashboard</a></h4><p style="margin-left: 20px;">During an election, you can explore our interactive Ballot Return Statistics Dashboard to see ballot return stats and voter turnout trends. The data provided is unofficial and for informational purposes.</p><h4 style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 2px;"><a style="color:black;" href="https://www.snohomishcountywa.gov/5737/Get-Current-and-Past-Election-Results-an">Election Results</a></h4><p style="margin-left: 20px;">Initial&nbsp;<a href="https://snohomishcountywa.gov/5737/Get-Current-and-Past-Election-Results-an">results</a> will be available after 8 p.m. on Election Night.<br><br>Processing, verifying, and counting all eligible ballots takes time. After the release of initial results on Election Night, results will continue to be updated at the end of each day, depending on the number of ballots left to process. Results are unofficial until certified by the Snohomish County Canvassing Board.<br><br></p><h3 style="background-color:#284860; color:white; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px;margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em;">Related Topics</h3>
    </div>

